blurb:
Discover Miami like never before on this 20-min private helicopter tour that combines luxury, comfort, and spectacular aerial views. Fly aboard our brand-new 2025 Helicopter R44, featuring a sleek black-and-gold design. Glide over the stunning coastline and enjoy panoramic sights of South Miami, Biscayne Bay, the scenic shoreline of Coconut Grove, Coral Gables, and the sparkling waters of Brickell Key in downtown. You’ll also catch breathtaking views of Virginia Key and Key Biscayne in the distance. Whether you're visiting with family, hosting out-of-town guests, or making memories with close friends, this experience is a thrilling and unforgettable way to see the Magic City from above.
Highlights:
Luxury 2025 Helicopter, the only helicopter in Miami equipped with air conditioning;
Spectacular Views: Capture incredible photos of Miami’s skyline, beaches, and natural beauty;
See Marine Life from the Air: Spot dolphins, manatees, and more in the clear blue waters.
